DESCRIPTION:This workshop is your introduction to all the ways Montclair S
 tate University Libraries support your academic success. It covers what r
 esources are available to you (e.g.\, books\, articles\, films\, database
 s) and how you can access them\, including through interlibrary loan. You
 'll learn how to navigate the library website\, distinguish between popul
 ar and scholarly sources\, and get help from a librarian when working on 
 a research assignment.\nRegister Here: https://montclair.libcal.com/event
 /16797394\n\nHosted by: Sprague Library\n\nOnline Location: https://montc
 lair.libcal.com/event/16797394\n\nAdditional Information can be found at:
  https://montclair.campuslabs.com/engage/event/12452340
